---
// src/pages/privacy.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy & GDPR Compliance • Run My Brief">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#F8FAFC] text-[#0F172A] px-6 py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-10">
      
      <!-- HEADER -->
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-6 space-y-3">
        <a href="/" class="text-xs text-[#2563EB] hover:underline font-mono font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 transition">
          <span>&larr;</span> <span>Return to Sandbox Overview</span>
        </a>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-[#2563EB] font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
          Legal &amp; Data Protection
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-[#0F172A]">
          Privacy Policy &amp; Data Governance
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">Last Updated: October 2026</p>
      </div>

      <!-- BODY CONTENT -->
      <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-[#334155] leading-relaxed">
        
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs text-slate-900 font-mono">// 1. Purpose &amp; Scope</h2>
          <p>
            Run My Brief provides review-capture and snag-triage software designed for independent UK plumbing, heating, and trade service firms. This policy details how feedback data, technician dispatch identifiers, and homeowner contact information are processed in compliance with the UK GDPR and the Data Protection Act 2018.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs text-slate-900 font-mono">// 2. Lawful Basis for Processing</h2>
          <p>
            When a homeowner completes an engineer sign-off card:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-xs text-slate-600">
            <li><strong>Positive Reviews (4–5★):</strong> Homeowners are routed directly to external Google review listings. No review text is stored on our servers; reviews are published independently on Google under Google's terms.</li>
            <li><strong>Snag Escalations (1–3★):</strong> Feedback notes and homeowner contact details are transmitted under legitimate interest directly to the trade firm's office dispatch line to allow swift resolution of workmanship snags.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs text-slate-900 font-mono">// 3. Data Retention &amp; Security</h2>
          <p>
            Snag reports delivered via webhooks or dispatch notifications are retained only as long as necessary for audit and resolution verification. All data in transit is encrypted using standard TLS protocols.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs text-slate-900 font-mono">// 4. Individual Rights</h2>
          <p>
            Homeowners and trade firm staff have the right to request access to, rectification of, or permanent deletion of their recorded feedback by contacting <a href="mailto:jimmy@runmybrief.com" class="text-[#2563EB] font-mono underline hover:text-blue-800 transition">jimmy@runmybrief.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>